  "description": "exchangerate.host exchange-rate provider for Bodu.Financial. Fetches and parses the exchangerate.host time-series and historical JSON endpoints and serves the results as Bodu.Financial.ExchangeRates.ExchangeRate values through IDatedRateProvider and IRateProvider, with an async range API over currency pairs. Includes the dependency-injection registration extensions (AddExchangeRateHostExchangeRates) for IServiceCollection and IFinancialServiceBuilder.",
